# Built server binary. Anchored with a leading slash: a bare `vaultsync`
# pattern also matches the DIRECTORY cmd/vaultsync, which silently kept the
# server's entrypoint out of the repository until a CI cross-compile failed
# with "cmd/vaultsync: directory not found".
/vaultsync-server
/vaultsync-client
/dist/
*.test

# Plugin build output
node_modules/
/main.js
dist-test/
*.js.map
data.json
